OL,3,ATeenage boy guilty of trying to murder
OL,4,Agirl, 15, in school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy who had a hatred of women
OL,7,Fand an "obsessive interest" in killers
OL,8,Fhas been found guilty of the attempted
OL,9,Fmurder of a girl at his school.
OL,11,FThe boy dressed in black and wore a
OL,12,Fface mask before stabbing the
OL,13,F15-year-old victim in the back at
OL,14,FThorpe St Andrew School, near Norwich,
OL,15,Fin March.
OL,17,FArmed police were called to the school,
OL,18,Fwhich went into lockdown, and the
OL,19,Fattack was caught on CCTV.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
