OL,3,ATeenage boy guilty of trying to murder
OL,4,Agirl, 15, in school
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boy, who is 16 and cannot be named
OL,7,Ffor legal reasons, wrote notes about
OL,8,Fhating women and had an "obsessive and
OL,9,Fdangerous interest in killers and
OL,10,Fkilling", jurors at King's Lynn Crown
OL,11,FCourt were told. He will be sentenced
OL,12,Fon 18 December.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
